known","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"授官、爵位、俸秩與敘事用稱分存；未知起訖不補造，卒日不自動終止全部稱號，未准乞骸骨不作辭相。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[{"id":"pa-shiji103-006","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","relation":"migration_destination","place":{"source_name":"陽陵","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p022","quote":"仁爲人陰重不泄，常衣敝補衣溺袴，期爲不絜淸，以是得幸。景帝入臥内，於後宮祕戲，仁常在旁。至景帝崩，仁尚爲郎中令，終無所言。上時問人，仁曰：「上自察之。」然亦無所毀。以此景帝再自幸其家。家徙陽陵。上所賜甚多，然常讓，不敢受也。諸侯群臣賂遺，終無所受。"}],"source_term":"家徙陽陵","interpretation_note":"按來源主體記出身或遷徙，父趙人不改作石奮籍貫，周仁先故任城人不當本人籍貫。保留地名原字，不補今日行政區。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false},{"id":"pa-shiji103-007","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","relation":"ancestral_origin","place":{"source_name":"任城","place_id":null,"modern_identification":null},"status":"source_attested","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p021","quote":"郎中令周文者，名仁，其先故任城人也。以醫見。景帝爲太子時，拜爲舍人，積功稍遷，孝文帝時至太中大夫。景帝初即位，拜仁爲郎中令。"}],"source_term":"其先故任城人也","qualifiers":{"subject_scope":"ancestors_unspecified","ancestor_person_id":null,"generation_distance":null},"interpretation_note":"來源只說其先，不指定哪位祖先或世代；記祖先出身，不當周仁本人籍貫，也不新增虛構祖先。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false}],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji103-024","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","surfaces":["仁","周文"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-103-wanshi"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p021","quote":"郎中令周文者，名仁，其先故任城人也。以醫見。景帝爲太子時，拜爲舍人，積功稍遷，孝文帝時至太中大夫。景帝初即位，拜仁爲郎中令。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p022","quote":"仁爲人陰重不泄，常衣敝補衣溺袴，期爲不絜淸，以是得幸。景帝入臥内，於後宮祕戲，仁常在旁。至景帝崩，仁尚爲郎中令，終無所言。上時問人，仁曰：「上自察之。」然亦無所毀。以此景帝再自幸其家。家徙陽陵。上所賜甚多，然常讓，不敢受也。諸侯群臣賂遺，終無所受。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p023","quote":"武帝立，以爲先帝臣，重之。仁乃病免，以二千石祿歸老，子孫咸至大官矣。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p026","quote":"太史公曰：仲尼有言曰「君子欲訥於言而敏於行」，其萬石、建陵、張叔之謂邪？是以其教不肅而成，不嚴而治。塞侯微巧，而周文處讇君子譏之，爲其近於佞也。然斯可謂篤行君子矣！"}],"rationale":"依本篇姓名、稱號、名歐及名仁等明示與敘事承接判讀；來源原字保留，未自動跨篇同名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p021","text":"郎中令周文者，名仁，其先故任城人也。以醫見。景帝爲太子時，拜爲舍人，積功稍遷，孝文帝時至太中大夫。景帝初即位，拜仁爲郎中令。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m021-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"周文","kind":"person","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m021-0008","start":8,"end":9,"surface":"仁","kind":"person","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m021-0010","start":10,"end":12,"surface":"其先","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、待辨典故或誣告與否認，不補具名人物或親屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m021-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"0g7_4bm_srb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m021-0039","start":39,"end":42,"surface":"孝文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"vkx_o6x_yz4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m021-0049","start":49,"end":51,"surface":"景帝","kind":"person","person_id":"0g7_4bm_srb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m021-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"仁","kind":"person","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p022","text":"仁爲人陰重不泄，常衣敝補衣溺袴，期爲不絜淸，以是得幸。景帝入臥内，於後宮祕戲，仁常在旁。至景帝崩，仁尚爲郎中令，終無所言。上時問人，仁曰：「上自察之。」然亦無所毀。以此景帝再自幸其家。家徙陽陵。上所賜甚多，然常讓，不敢受也。諸侯群臣賂遺，終無所受。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sh